abstract: "Original procedural task generators, pixel-based controlled perception, costly sensing and simulated action consequences, typed tool interfaces, bounded certificates, optional historical Lean assurance and statistical reporting for masked component recovery. Frontier-model difficulty and real-robot transfer are not established."
